  "system": {
    "summary": {
      "value": ""
    },
    "description": "<p>When you cast an offensive spell (@ICON[offensive]) targeting a <strong>single creature</strong>, if the spell has a <strong>total Mind Point cost of 【SL × 20】 or lower</strong>, you may choose one <strong>non-arcane weapon</strong> you have equipped. If you do, your Magic Check for the spell uses the chosen <strong>weapon</strong>'s Accuracy Check formula; if that formula includes <strong>Dexterity</strong>, the Magic Check also gains a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】.</strong></p><p>For instance, casting a spell through a <strong>bronze sword</strong> when you have <strong>Skill Level 2</strong> in <strong>Spellblade</strong> will cause the Magic Check to be <strong>【DEX + MIG】 +3</strong> instead of <strong>【INS + WLP】</strong>.</p>",
